01:13:17.724 --> 01:13:18.857
Yep.


01:13:18.891 --> 01:13:20.759
- Dad?
- Dad?


01:13:20.793 --> 01:13:24.196
Jesus Christ.


01:13:33.840 --> 01:13:36.576
I'll miss you.


01:14:19.919 --> 01:14:21.020
