01:15:07.233 --> 01:15:09.302
Fuck's sake.


01:15:12.339 --> 01:15:13.839
Shit.


01:15:13.873 --> 01:15:15.040
Fucking hell.


01:15:15.074 --> 01:15:16.075
Darling.


01:15:16.109 --> 01:15:17.310
- Dad.
- Dad.


01:15:33.025 --> 01:15:35.462
I haven't
said goodbye to Nell!


01:15:35.496 --> 01:15:36.729
