01:19:00.734 --> 01:19:02.134
On the bed.


01:19:11.177 --> 01:19:13.011
Jesus.


01:19:13.045 --> 01:19:14.414
How much did I drink?


01:19:14.448 --> 01:19:17.215
Fucking hell!
For fuck sake!


01:19:17.249 --> 01:19:18.951
