01:19:26.092 --> 01:19:28.227
Five fucking minutes!


01:20:24.718 --> 01:20:26.251
Dad?


01:21:17.737 --> 01:21:19.539
What the fuck, Bella?


01:21:19.573 --> 01:21:22.074
