01:21:51.705 --> 01:21:57.175
I want you to imagine a cloud
that's... a giant cloud


01:21:57.209 --> 01:21:59.177
that's made of candy...
Oh, my God!


01:21:59.211 --> 01:22:00.613
I haven't said goodbye
to Sandra.


01:22:00.647 --> 01:22:01.881
