01:22:33.780 --> 01:22:35.715
I love you, dad.


01:22:35.749 --> 01:22:38.518
I love you, Thomas.


01:22:38.552 --> 01:22:40.854
I love you, darling.


01:22:43.323 --> 01:22:46.325
